<h1>Basic document<a id="fnref1" href="#fn1" role="doc-noteref"><sup>1</sup></a></h1>
<p>This paragraph has <em>emphasis</em>, <strong>strong text</strong>, <code>inline code</code>, a
<a href="other.djot">relative link</a>, an <a href="https://djot.net/">absolute link</a>, and a
footnote.<a id="fnref2" href="#fn2" role="doc-noteref"><sup>2</sup></a></p>
<section id="Lists-and-quotes">
